From d6c6a7b2900e8a66dfb3dffc38adfb1d4a1da61b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 2 Sep 2026 15:20:50 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Combine Start Day / Check In into one tabbed screen;
 camera-only capture
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Replaces the separate Start Day and Check In screens with a single
DayCheckIn.jsx (two tabs: Day, Check In) built from an approved mockup,
and closes a real attendance gap: a rep could previously still check in
after ending their day.

- Day tab: start/end the day, plus a running Day Activity log (day
  start/end, check-ins/outs, and free-text notes the rep adds) via new
  sales_day_notes table + get_my_day_activity()/add_day_note() RPCs.
- End Day is blocked while a visit is still open (checkout first), and
  once the day is ended, Check In is fully blocked until a new day is
  started tomorrow — sales_day_starts.ended_at + a new end_day() RPC,
  with start_dealer_visit() checking it.
- Check In tab: tapping a dealer checks in immediately (no confirm
  step) and this same tab becomes the checkout screen and stays that
  way — one open check-in at a time, mandatory checkout, never drops
  back to the Day tab.
- New CameraCapture.jsx (CameraPhotoSlot/CameraVideoSlot): every photo
  and video now comes from a live getUserMedia stream, never a file/
  gallery picker, so an old or fake photo can't be substituted. Geo-tag
  + timestamp are burned onto every photo at capture time. Replaces
  PhotoSlot.jsx and the native <input capture> pattern everywhere
  (DealerDetail's checkout, the day-start meter photo).
- Purple border added to every plain white card across the Sales
  screens (dashboard stat cards, dealer/visit lists, feature tiles,
  dealer detail cards).
- Old /staff/sales/start-day and /staff/sales/check-in routes now
  redirect to the new /staff/sales/day-checkin.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
